    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d510">

                <pb facs="0495" n="483" sameAs="frus:frus1943v04/pg483"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.24591/20: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Minister in Iran</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Dreyfus</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-12-02T16:00:00-04:00">December 2, 1943—4
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>612. War Department states that it has no objection to deletion of the expression
                    quoted in first paragraph of your telegram no. 1082, November 30, 6 p.m., and
                    you are authorized to delete it.</p>
                <pb facs="0496" n="484" xml:id="pg484"/>
                <p>You are also authorized to conclude an agreement with the Iranian Government
                    regarding jurisdiction in criminal cases of American troops in Iran, provided
                    such agreement is acceptable to General Connolly.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
